{"id":"40431653a082dc65","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-truth-set-modal.md","title":"Truth Set in Modal Logic","display":"prop-truth-set-modal — Truth Set in Modal Logic","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-truth-set-modal","aliases":["89-prop-truth-set-modal"],"display":"prop-truth-set-modal — Truth Set in Modal Logic","depends_on":["[[89-df-truth-set]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-truth-set-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-truth-set-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-truth-set-modal — Truth Set in Modal Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"774a7723667e1813\" href=\"?note=774a7723667e1813\" title=\"89-df-truth-set\">89-df-truth-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)\\)</span> is a Kripke model.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\varphi]_{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq W\">\\([\\varphi]_{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq W\\)</span> is the truth set from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"774a7723667e1813\" href=\"?note=774a7723667e1813\" title=\"89-df-truth-set\">89-df-truth-set</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}set\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n[\\varphi]_{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W\\mid\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}set\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n[\\varphi]_{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W\\mid\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\varphi]_{\\mathcal M}\">\\([\\varphi]_{\\mathcal M}\\)</span> : 真值集 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"774a7723667e1813\" href=\"?note=774a7723667e1813\" title=\"89-df-truth-set\">89-df-truth-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> : 模态满足</li>\n<li>该命题展开源定义，并沿用其单方括号记号；不另造一套双括号签名。</li>\n<li>模态语义的基本概念</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-truth-set","status":"resolved","id":"774a7723667e1813","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-truth-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"",